   "source": [
    "# Function 1 — 2D Contamination Detection\n",
    "\n",
    "**Surrogate:** GP with Matérn 5/2 kernel\n",
    "**Acquisition:** Upper Confidence Bound (UCB), β = 1.96\n",
    "**Key issue:** the raw outputs span roughly 180 orders of magnitude, so a\n",
    "transform is required before the GP can learn anything at all.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "Two inputs in [0, 1], one scalar output. One query per week, five rounds\n",
    "completed. The goal is to find the input that maximises the output."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
