    "The table above is the whole argument in one view.\n",
    "\n",
    "The two negative readings now sit at roughly **−2.4** and **−2.9**, while\n",
    "everything else falls to −40 and below. Before the transform those same points\n",
    "were −3.6e-03 and −1.3e-03 against a field of values like 1e-124 — differences\n",
    "the kernel simply could not resolve.\n",
    "\n",
    "After transforming, the acquisition function has a clear target region."
   ]
